[I] Library for communicating with spacenavd or 3dxsrv

[T] libspnav is a C library for receiving input from 6 degrees-of-freedom
[T] input devices, such as 3Dconnexion space mice. It talks to the spacenavd
[T] daemon, or the proprietary 3dxsrv via the X11 protocol, and can replace
[T] the 3Dconnexion SDK library.

[U] https://spacenav.sourceforge.net/

[A] Libspnav Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

